Operator Profile#&ldquo;You can&rsquo;t fight what you can&rsquo;t see.&rdquo;
Basic Information#Attribute Value Real Name Yuki Tanaka Codename WRAITH Class Recon Nationality Japanese Age 26 Height 162 cm (5'4&quot;) Weight 52 kg (115 lbs) Background#Yuki Tanaka was a prodigy in Japan&rsquo;s Special Forces Group, specializing in infiltration and evasion. Her small stature and uncanny ability to vanish made her perfect for covert operations where detection meant death.
A failed mission in Taiwan left her squad dead and Yuki blamed by superiors looking for a scapegoat. She vanished into the criminal underworld before emerging in the Exclusion Zone, where her talents for disappearing are appreciated rather than punished.
