Operator Profile#&ldquo;Behind me. Nothing gets through.&rdquo;
Basic Information#Attribute Value Real Name Hans Friedrich Richter Codename BULWARK Class Tank Nationality German Age 41 Height 195 cm (6'5&quot;) Weight 110 kg (243 lbs) Background#Hans Richter was the immovable object of GSG 9, Germany&rsquo;s elite counter-terrorism unit. His ability to hold positions under overwhelming fire became legendary after a 2019 embassy siege where he protected 30 hostages for 8 hours with only a riot shield and his determination.
After a political scandal forced budget cuts that disbanded his unit, Hans couldn&rsquo;t return to civilian life. The Exclusion Zone offers what he needs: a clear mission, enemies to stop, and people to protect.
